{"suttaId":"tha-ap541","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[4762,4854],"vripara":"296"},"segments":{"tha-ap541:0.3":"Rādhattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap541:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbalokavidū muni;","tha-ap541:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji cakkhumā.","tha-ap541:2.1":"“Ovādako viññāpako, tārako sabbapāṇinaṃ;","tha-ap541:2.3":"Desanākusalo buddho, tāresi janataṃ bahuṃ.","tha-ap541:3.1":"“Anukampako kāruṇiko, hitesī sabbapāṇinaṃ;","tha-ap541:3.3":"Sampatte titthiye sabbe, pañcasīle patiṭṭhapi.","tha-ap541:4.1":"“Evaṃ nirākulaṃ āsi, suññataṃ titthiyehi ca;","tha-ap541:4.3":"Vicittaṃ arahantehi, vasībhūtehi tādibhi.","tha-ap541:5.1":"“Ratanānaṭṭhapaññāsaṃ, uggato so mahāmuni;","tha-ap541:5.3":"Kañcanagghiyasaṅkāso, bāttiṃsavaralakkhaṇo.","tha-ap541:6.1":"“Vassasatasahassāni, āyu vijjati tāvade;","tha-ap541:6.3":"Tāvatā tiṭṭhamāno so, tāresi janataṃ bahuṃ.","tha-ap541:7.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, brāhmaṇo mantapāragū;","tha-ap541:7.3":"Upecca taṃ naravaraṃ, assosiṃ dhammadesanaṃ.","tha-ap541:8.1":"“Paññapentaṃ mahāvīraṃ, parisāsu visāradaṃ;","tha-ap541:8.3":"Paṭibhāneyyakaṃ bhikkhuṃ, etadagge vināyakaṃ.","tha-ap541:9.1":"“Tadāhaṃ kāraṃ katvāna, sasaṅghe lokanāyake;","tha-ap541:9.3":"Nipacca sirasā pāde, taṃ ṭhānaṃ abhipatthayiṃ.","tha-ap541:10.1":"“Tato maṃ bhagavā āha, siṅgīnikkhasamappabho;","tha-ap541:10.3":"Sarena rajanīyena, kilesamalahārinā.","tha-ap541:11.1":"“‘Sukhī bhavassu dīghāyu, sijjhatu paṇidhī tava;","tha-ap541:11.3":"Sasaṅghe me kataṃ kāraṃ, atīva vipulaṃ tayā.","tha-ap541:12.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap541:12.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap541:13.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;","tha-ap541:13.3":"Rādhoti nāmadheyyena, hessati satthu sāvako.","tha-ap541:14.1":"“‘Sa te hetuguṇe tuṭṭho, sakyaputto narāsabho [idaṃ pādadvayaṃ syāmamūle natthī];","tha-ap541:14.3":"Paṭibhāneyyakānaggaṃ, paññapessati nāyako’.","tha-ap541:15.1":"“Taṃ sutvā mudito hutvā, yāvajīvaṃ tadā jinaṃ;","tha-ap541:15.3":"Mettacitto paricariṃ, sato paññāsamāhito.","tha-ap541:16.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap541:16.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap541:17.1":"“Satānaṃ tīṇikkhattuñca, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap541:17.3":"Satānaṃ pañcakkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ.","tha-ap541:18.1":"“Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ;","tha-ap541:18.3":"Sabbattha sukhito āsiṃ, tassa kammassa vāhasā.","tha-ap541:19.1":"“Pacchime bhave sampatte, giribbajapuruttame;","tha-ap541:19.3":"Jāto vippakule niddhe, vikalacchādanāsane.","tha-ap541:20.1":"“Kaṭacchubhikkhaṃ pādāsiṃ, sāriputtassa tādino;","tha-ap541:20.3":"Yadā jiṇṇo ca vuddho ca, tadārāmamupāgamiṃ.","tha-ap541:21.1":"“Pabbajati na maṃ koci [pabbājenti na maṃ keci (sī. syā pī.)], jiṇṇadubbalathāmakaṃ;","tha-ap541:21.3":"Tena dīno vivaṇṇaṅgo [vivaṇṇako (ka.)], soko cāsiṃ tadā ahaṃ.","tha-ap541:22.1":"“Disvā mahākāruṇiko, mamamāha [mamāha so (sī.), mamāha ca (pī.)] mahāmuni;","tha-ap541:22.3":"‘Kimatthaṃ puttasokaṭṭo, brūhi te cittajaṃ rujaṃ’.","tha-ap541:23.1":"“‘Pabbajjaṃ na labhe vīra, svākkhāte tava sāsane;","tha-ap541:23.3":"Tena sokena dīnosmi, saraṇaṃ hohi nāyaka’.","tha-ap541:24.1":"“Tadā bhikkhū samānetvā, apucchi munisattamo;","tha-ap541:24.3":"‘Imassa adhikāraṃ ye, saranti byāharantu te’.","tha-ap541:25.1":"“Sāriputto tadāvoca,‘kāramassa sarāmahaṃ;","tha-ap541:25.3":"Kaṭacchubhikkhaṃ dāpesi, piṇḍāya carato mama’.","tha-ap541:26.1":"“‘Sādhu sādhu kataññūsi, sāriputta imaṃ tuvaṃ;","tha-ap541:26.3":"Pabbājehi dijaṃ vuḍḍhaṃ, hessatājāniyo ayaṃ’.","tha-ap541:27.1":"“Tato alatthaṃ pabbajjaṃ, kammavācopasampadaṃ;","tha-ap541:27.3":"Na cireneva kālena, pāpuṇiṃ āsavakkhayaṃ.","tha-ap541:28.1":"“Sakkaccaṃ munino vākyaṃ, suṇāmi mudito yato;","tha-ap541:28.3":"Paṭibhāneyyakānaggaṃ, tato maṃ ṭhapayī jino.","tha-ap541:29.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap541:30.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap541:31.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap541:32.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā rādho thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap541:33.1":"Rādhattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3497,"to":3497,"paras":[{"para":3497,"vripara":"296","refs":["tha-ap541:1"],"lines":["Navamāpadāne <b>padumuttaro nāma jino</b>tiādikaṃ āyasmato rādhattherassa apadānaṃ.","Taṃ sabbaṃ pāṭhānusārena nayānucintanena viññūhi suviññeyyameva.","Kevalaṃ puññanānattamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap541:1"],["tha-ap541:1"],["tha-ap541:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap541:1.1","padumuttaro nāma jino",0,0]],"before":[{"para":3495,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Uruvelakassapattheraapadānavaṇṇanā samattā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":3496,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Rādhattheraapadānavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
